</ul><p><strong>Culture - We All Shape It</strong></p><p>As part of a rapidly scaling start up, you will be instrumental in shaping our culture. </p><p>Are you interested in finding out more about our culture? Learn more about our values <a href="https://clickhouse.com/company/careers" rel="nofollow ugc noopener" target="_blank">here</a>. Check out our<a href="https://clickhouse.com/blog" rel="nofollow ugc noopener" target="_blank"> blog posts</a> or follow us on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/clickhouseinc/life/0c1ee7f4-2129-488d-b413-e7f6270659fd/?viewAsMember=true" rel="nofollow ugc noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a> to find out more about what’s happening at ClickHouse.</p><p><strong>Equal Opportunity &amp; Privacy </strong></p><p>ClickHouse provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type based on factors such as race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. </p><p>Please see <a href="https://clickhouse.com/legal/applicant-privacy-notice" target="_blank" rel="nofollow ugc noopener">here</a> for our Privacy Statement.</p>",
